{"9":[{"k":"p","t":"OPTIONAL SWITCH SETTINGS"},{"k":"p","t":"The optional switch settings for the game are found on the C.P.U. Board. They will aid you in your game selection format. Dip Switch A controls the number of coins per game, and also the the number of ships allotted per game. The following settings can also be found described on mode 6 of the self diagnostic test modes. (See System Diagnostics section for further explanation.)"},{"k":"p","t":"DIP SWITCH A"},{"k":"p","t":"Switches 1 and 2, of this switch, control the number of coins per game:"},{"k":"tr","t":"SWITCH 1   SWITCH 2   COINS PER GAME"},{"k":"tr","t":"oft   off   1 Coin per game"},{"k":"tr","t":"on   Of\u00a3t   2 Coins per 1 game ar"},{"k":"p","t":"3 Coins per 2 games"},{"k":"tr","t":"oft   On   2 Coins per game"},{"k":"tr","t":"On   On   Free Play"},{"k":"p","t":"Switches 3 through 6 are factory settings. They are to remain in the OFF position."},{"k":"p","t":"Switches 7 & 8 control the number of ships allotted per game:"},{"k":"tr","t":"SWITCH 7   SWITCH 8   NO. OF SHIPS PER GAME"},{"k":"tr","t":"Off   off   a"},{"k":"tr","t":"on   off   4"},{"k":"tr","t":"off   on   5"},{"k":"tr","t":"on   on   6"},{"k":"p","t":"Dip Switch B controls the number of points at which a Bonus Ship is awarded, as well as some factory settings also described on mode six of the self diagnostic test modes."},{"k":"p","t":"DIP SWITCH B"},{"k":"p","t":"Switches 1 through 3 control the Bonus Ship for different point levels."},{"k":"tr","t":"SWITCH 1   SWITCH 2   SWITCH 3   BONUS SHIP AWARDED AT"},{"k":"tr","t":"On   on   on   30,000 Points"},{"k":"tr","t":"off   off   off   40,000 Points"},{"k":"tr","t":"on   off   oft   50,000 Points"},{"k":"tr","t":"off   on   oft   60,000 Points"},{"k":"tr","t":"on   on   Off   70,000 Points"},{"k":"tr","t":"off   oft   On   80,000 Points"},{"k":"tr","t":"On   Off   On   90,000 Points"},{"k":"p","t":"Switches 4 & 5 are factory settings and remain in the OFF position. Switches 6 & 7 ar